{title: Dekha Hai Pehli Baar}
{artist: S P Balsubramaniam Alka Yagnik Nadeem Shravan Saajan91}
{key: Am}

{c: Verse 1}
[Am]Dekha hai [F]pahli baar
[F]sajan [G]ki aankho [Am]me pyar
[Am]Tab jaake [F]aaya mere
[F]bechain [G]dil [Am]ko karaar
[Am]Dilbar tujhe [G]milne ko
[G]kab se [Am]tha mai bekarar
[Am]Tab jaake [F]aaya mere
[F]bechain [G]dil [Am]ko karaar
[Am]Palake jhukaau
[Dm]tujhe dil me basaau
[C]Abb bin tere mai
[G]toh kahee [Am]chain naa paau
[Am]Tu mera jigar hai tu meri nazar hai
[Am]Tu [G]meri aarazu
[F]tu mera [Am]hamsafar hai
[Am]Dekha hai [F]pahli baar ....
[Am]Meri adaaye
[Dm]yeh meree javaanee
[C]Bas tere liye hai
[G]yeh [Am]meree jindagaanee
[Am]Tu meri ghazal hai tu mera tarana
[Am]Aa teri [G]dhadkano pe
[F]likh du [Am]dil ka fasana
[Am]Dekha hai [F]pahli baar
